// Hotaru, the firefly who lives in your lantern (ADR-0061). Drawn after the Genji firefly of Japan: a black body,
// a red-orange collar, and a tail that glows yellow-green (the game adds the light around it). Two wing beats per
// facing; she is small, 16 x 16, and floats beside you.

legend K hair_black.1
legend J hair_black.2
legend R cloth_red.1
legend S cloth_orange.0
legend W cloth_white.0
legend V water.0
legend U water.1
legend G firefly.0
legend H firefly.1
legend I firefly.2
legend N glow.0
legend Y glow.1

sprite hotaru 16 16

frame down.up
................
