// The notice above her head: a "!" in the glow colours with an ink outline, 5 x 7 (build.py cuts it out as
// hotaru-notice.png). Drawn at the frame's top left, so the rest of the 16 x 16 frame stays clear.
frame notice at 0 0
..#..
.#N#.
.#N#.
.#Y#.
..#..
.#N#.
